import QIQTH.ExpJet5TeleA
import Mathlib
/-!
# JET-5 phase-5 split, scalar closing identity (J4-650)

The pure-`ℝ` closing identity of the `ρ₅`-telescope: the assembled 202-sub-term bound (in the
ten opaque blocks `E,eKf,CPD,B2..B5,T2..T4`, constrained by their defining equations) times
the outer Gronwall factor `e^{Kstar}` equals `expJet5VtpConst · vw·nh·nk·nl·nm·nr`.  Isolated
in its own declaration so the heavy `ring` runs with NO geometry and a minimal context.

## Honest firewall (binding)

Pure real arithmetic; closes part of J5-3 only.  NOT `exp_p ∈ C⁵`, NOT `κ = 1/6`, NOT the
heat-kernel parametrix, NOT `a₁ = R/6` (which remains CONDITIONAL — flat tower non-vacuous;
curved owes Jet-5 completion + Duhamel carry + fat-K carriers + capstone co-instantiation).
-/
namespace QIQTH.ExpMap

set_option maxRecDepth 65536

set_option maxHeartbeats 25600000 in
